# Scancodes 183..194 (KEY_F13..KEY_F24) are DELIBERATELY unmapped, unlike
# AOSP's Generic.kl. This folio has no F13-F24 keys — stock ZUI's own layout for
# 17ef:62b2 has these twelve lines commented out — and custom input gestures are
# matched on keycode alone, with no device filter
# (InputGestureManager.getCustomGestureForKeyEvent, :499-513). Leaving them in
# would mean a firmware that ever emitted scancode 183 would silently fire the
# pen's one-click action. Removing them costs nothing and closes that aliasing
# hazard. See the F-key allocation table in the header.
